# Capacitor / Android — the native project is generated fresh by the
# GitHub Actions workflow on every run (npx cap add android), not
# committed, so a partially-generated or stale copy can never get
# checked in by accident. Also blocks any keystore/signing secrets
# from ever being committed if someone generates a release build
# locally.
/android
/ios
*.keystore
*.jks
local.properties
